{"id":"n47166-1-4","stage":4,"title":"동문서답 · 答非所问","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n47166-1-4-1","ko":"저는 버스 타고 왔어요.","zh":"我是坐公交车来的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저는","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저는","audio":"/audio/0b05af6c0b14d6e70820.mp3"}},{"text":"버스","meaning":"公共汽车，公交车","explanation":"버스：公共汽车，公交车","readings":[{"term":"버스","audio":"/audio/fb84fa7f86eac62eca5f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36678","senseId":"1","lemma":"버스","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"버스","audio":"/audio/fb84fa7f86eac62eca5f.mp3"}},{"text":"타고","meaning":"乘，乘坐","explanation":"타다：乘，乘坐；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"타다","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17160","senseId":"1","lemma":"타다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"타고","audio":"/audio/8aebcd33801f792f7638.mp3"}},{"text":"왔어요.","meaning":"来，来到","explanation":"오다：来，来到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"1","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왔어요","audio":"/audio/2ef5daa5f516291289bc.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"fb84fa7f86eac62e","term":"버스","zh":"公共汽车，公交车","audio":"/audio/fb84fa7f86eac62eca5f.mp3","entryId":"36678","definition":"收取费用、按照规定路线行驶、可乘坐多人的大汽车。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"8f835109fdc29a59","term":"타다","zh":"乘，乘坐","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3","entryId":"17160","definition":"坐到交通工具或当作交通工具的动物背上。","pronunciation":["타다"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"从别的地方移动到这个地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9c2a427dd65722632c06.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n47166-1-4-2","ko":"저녁 먹었냐니까 웬 동문서답이니?","zh":"我问你吃晚饭没，怎么答非所问呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저녁","meaning":"晚饭，晚餐","explanation":"저녁：晚饭，晚餐","readings":[{"term":"저녁","audio":"/audio/8d3c547011f433e6d259.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71220","senseId":"2","lemma":"저녁","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저녁","audio":"/audio/8d3c547011f433e6d259.mp3"}},{"text":"먹었냐니까","meaning":"吃；表示说这样那样的话。","explanation":"먹다：吃；하다：表示说这样那样的话。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；냐고：转述问句：“问是否、问为什么……”。；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"},{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"28","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹었냐니까","audio":"/audio/0534a59b764630bd4fd1.mp3"}},{"text":"웬","meaning":"什么，哪儿来的","explanation":"웬：什么，哪儿来的","readings":[{"term":"웬","audio":"/audio/0eb778191ab3a0e588b9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69527","senseId":"1","lemma":"웬","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"웬","audio":"/audio/0eb778191ab3a0e588b9.mp3"}},{"text":"동문서답이니?","meaning":"答非所问","explanation":"동문서답：答非所问；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"동문서답","audio":"/audio/1fc2aa6908142fbe2394.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47166","senseId":"1","lemma":"동문서답","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"동문서답이니","audio":"/audio/601ad07029b5981dd72e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8d3c547011f433e6","term":"저녁","zh":"晚饭，晚餐","audio":"/audio/8d3c547011f433e6d259.mp3","entryId":"71220","definition":"晚上吃的饭。","pronunciation":["저녁"]},{"id":"9639f892